# ThreadSanitizer suppressions — each entry documents a DELIBERATE
# benign race; anything not listed here fails the tsan-gate.
#
# None at present. The deadlock watchdog scanner and sw_stats used to be
# suppressed here; their cross-thread fields are now _Atomic (process pid
# and mailbox priv_head, scheduler counters, io port state/owner), so the
# gate runs them unsuppressed.
